cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "open-hadith-data: verified Arabic hadith texts cross-checked against independent editions"
authors:
  - name: "samt-qa"
repository-code: "https://github.com/samt-qa/open-hadith-data"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - hadith
  - sunnah
  - arabic
  - dataset
  - arabic-nlp
  - textual criticism
abstract: >-
  Structured JSON texts of the Nine Books of hadith and 18 further
  collections, extracted from al-Maktaba al-Shamela, collated word by word
  against an independent second edition, with every source correction
  documented alongside its witnesses.
